{"toolCallId":"call_4d68d198addf413c9a1c267c1d6a925c","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"\n---\n\n## 6. LEVEL RECOMMENDATION\n\n### recommend-level.sh\n\nRecommends appropriate documentation level based on feature characteristics.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n# Basic recommendation\nbash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh \"Add user authentication\"\n\n# With feature flags\nbash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh --auth --api \"Add OAuth login\"\n```\n\n**Feature Flags:**\n| Flag | Effect |\n|------|--------|\n| `--auth` | Increases level (security-sensitive) |\n| `--api` | Increases level (API changes) |\n| `--db` | Increases level (database changes) |\n| `--architectural` | Forces Level 3 |\n\n---\n\n## 7. TEMPLATE COMPOSITION\n\n### Level contract resolver\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w5963e3680a/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"abde59","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
{"toolCallId":"call_52845cc650b94f87aee6b216a80a87a4","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"===\n109:    \"description\": \"Checks anchors in each spec doc whose template defines them, ignoring fenced code; a phase parent is exempt, and research/research.md and review/review-report.md are skipped as free-form workflow documents. Errors: a doc with no anchors, an anchor opened twice, never closed, closed but never opened, or closed more times than it is opened. Nesting is also an error: an anchor opened inside another, closed before it is opened, or closed while another is still open, though markers quoted in inline code are ignored by the nesting check; an adr-NNN anchor may hold adr-NNN-* anchors. A doc stamped v2.3 or later must also carry every anchor its template requires, meaning each section whose H2 header has no L2:, L3:, L3+: or FIX ADDENDUM: prefix, and each missing one is an error that names the doc, the anchor and the heading to restore. Template order is not checked.\"\n130:    \"description\": \"Validates generated merge payloads against target anchor shape.\"\n248:    \"description\": \"Checks every markdown document in a spec folder against the greppable-corpus convention: frontmatter variant, trigger phrase quality, anchor grammar and naming.\"\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w5963e3680a/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"0809c9","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
